        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Just the Two of Us\", \"Bette Davis Eyes\"\n- People: Donna Weiss, Jackie DeShannon\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100\n\nFacts:\n- An edited version of \"Just the Two of Us\" reached number two on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"Bette Davis Eyes,\" a song written and composed by Donna Weiss and Jackie DeShannon, spent nine weeks at number one on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"Just the Two of Us\" was kept from number one on the Billboard Hot 100 by \"Bette Davis Eyes.\"",
